<https://w3id.org/ucf-dpv/knowledge-workflow/codebase#function/src/agents/base.py:Agent.call_rows> a owl:NamedIndividual,
        kw:CodeUnitSpecification ;
    rdfs:label "src/agents/base.py:Agent.call_rows" ;
    rdfs:comment """Rows in batches; rows the model left out are sent again, up to retries times, each time in batches half
the size of the last (at least 5). Returns one answer entry per answered row id; coverage counts accumulate
in self.row_stats[stat or item] (recovered: by any retry; recovered_retryN: by retry N >= 2; reused: answered
from an earlier run with the identical row, see RowCache). value_key may be a tuple of fields that must all
be present.""" ;
    skos:definition """Rows in batches; rows the model left out are sent again, up to retries times, each time in batches half
the size of the last (at least 5). Returns one answer entry per answered row id; coverage counts accumulate
in self.row_stats[stat or item] (recovered: by any retry; recovered_retryN: by retry N >= 2; reused: answered
from an earlier run with the identical row, see RowCache). value_key may be a tuple of fields that must all
be present."""@en ;
