    kw:resourceText """You mark disjoint classes in a {{domain}} ontology. For each input class list the sibling ids (same parent) that can share NO instance with it - nothing can be both. Only when clearly true; a sibling that is a kind of it, overlaps with it, or could co-occur in one thing is NOT disjoint. Return an empty list when unsure.

Return ONLY JSON matching the schema.

SCHEMA
""" ;
