<https://w3id.org/ucf-dpv/knowledge-workflow/codebase#function/src/tools/ontostore.py:search> a owl:NamedIndividual,
        kw:CodeUnitSpecification ;
    rdfs:label "src/tools/ontostore.py:search" ;
    rdfs:comment """Candidates for one concept, ranked exact label matches first, then by a fused score of three signals:
exact (a normalised label equals one of texts), fuzzy (trigram similarity, FTS5 trigram index) and cosine
(vector against the term vectors; pass the concept's EMBED vector, or None for labels only). A candidate needs
one signal on its own (exact, fuzzy >= min_fuzzy or cosine >= min_cosine) and a fused score >= min_score;
the `nearest` closest terms by cosine are kept regardless (placement always sees the nearest classes).
kinds / ontologies restrict the result (e.g. kinds=("class",), ontologies=("CCO", "BFO")).""" ;
    skos:definition """Candidates for one concept, ranked exact label matches first, then by a fused score of three signals:
exact (a normalised label equals one of texts), fuzzy (trigram similarity, FTS5 trigram index) and cosine
(vector against the term vectors; pass the concept's EMBED vector, or None for labels only). A candidate needs
one signal on its own (exact, fuzzy >= min_fuzzy or cosine >= min_cosine) and a fused score >= min_score;
the `nearest` closest terms by cosine are kept regardless (placement always sees the nearest classes).
kinds / ontologies restrict the result (e.g. kinds=("class",), ontologies=("CCO", "BFO"))."""@en ;
    kw:callTargetText "' OR '.join",
        "ValueError",
        "_db",
        "_fuse",
        "_fuzzy",
