    rdfs:label "src/agents/base.py:items" ;
    rdfs:comment """The dict entries of obj[field], ignoring anything malformed.
Small models often answer in another shape; with value_key these are read too:
  {"k1": "quality", ...} or {field: {"k1": "quality"}}  -> [{"id": "k1", value_key: "quality"}]
  {"k1": {...}, ...}                                  -> [{"id": "k1", ...}]
  {"<other name>": [{...}]} (a single list under another key) -> that list""" ;
    skos:definition """The dict entries of obj[field], ignoring anything malformed.
