    kw:hasDataBinding <https://w3id.org/ucf-dpv/knowledge-workflow/codebase#binding/reports/index-md>,
        <https://w3id.org/ucf-dpv/knowledge-workflow/codebase#binding/reports/output-folder>,
        <https://w3id.org/ucf-dpv/knowledge-workflow/codebase#binding/reports/report-html>,
        <https://w3id.org/ucf-dpv/knowledge-workflow/codebase#binding/reports/report-md>,
